  "_about": "Gear for chapter 1: eight slots, as Zite has eight (Robin, 2026-11-20: 'There should also be more slots for items. Again, i think you can take a lot from the zite inventory and equip'). Which eight is Victor, GD's: cutlass, buckler, hat and coat show on him (Robin, 2026-11-20, 'The big pieces': every cutlass, buckler and hat has its own shape; coats come in a handful of looks; boots, gloves and rings show only in the bag); gloves and a ring add to his swing, boots to his health, a charm to his armour. Three tiers, four rarities. A piece is a base and a rarity; its numbers are the base's times the rarity's `times`, and never less than the base plus one for each step of rarity. Affixes, uniques and sets are chapter 2. `value` is what a common one is worth; the shop sells at value times `buyTimes` and buys at value times `sellShare`. Names are Victor, GD's placeholders.",
